validates the provider_id/provider_build pair: null or\\n2124:\\trawID, known := object[\\\"provider_id\\\"]\\n2139:\\trawBuild, known := object[\\\"provider_build\\\"]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 9639,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2410,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
