{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cec7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0c8-2197-71f2-b37c-575c8ab978c8"},"sequence":1470,"recorded_at":1780531400002935,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0d0-4d4e-7fa1-8fde-29cf72ce8357"},"task_id":"01a0b0d0-4d4e-7fa1-8fde-29cf72ce8357","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0d0-4d4e-7fa1-8fde-29cf72ce8357","chunk":"Read text file `internal/axpane/decide.go`.\n(177 line(s) above)\n178|\t// binds to; Verify checks evidence signatures.\n179|\tRawGeneration string\n180|\tVerify        terminalbackend.SignatureVerifier\n181|\t// Now is the admission instant for evidence liveness.\n182|\tNow time.Time\n183|}\n184|\n185|// Input is the complete Decide surface: validated configuration,\n186|// the loaded session, the local lease view, materialization and\n187|// checkpoint state, the profile chain, provider identity, backend\n188|// identity, realm readiness, and the bootstrap binding. I/O-free\n189|// callers build it by hand; Run builds it through the gates.go\n190|// adapters over the durable stores.\n191|type Input struct {\n192|\t// SessionID is the logical session under decision.\n193|\tSessionID string\n194|\t// BootstrapOperationID is the caller-stable bootstrap operation.\n195|\tBootstrapOperationID string\n196|\t// Mode selects the fencing entry and capability row.\n197|\tMode Mode\n198|\n199|\t// ConfigErr is the ValidateConfig outcome; non-nil refuses\n200|\t// invalid_config.\n201|\tConfigErr error\n202|\t// SessionKnown reports that the logical session loaded; false\n203|\t// refuses invalid_arguments.\n204|\tSessionKnown bool\n205|\n206|\t// ExistingBinding is the proven bootstrap binding, or nil when\n207|\t// Status proved absence. A changed operation refuses\n208|\t// idempotency_mismatch; a matching pair reattaches.\n209|\tExistingBinding *Binding\n210|\n211|\t// Presented is the local fencing token; Observation is the\n212|\t// verified lease view, built by fencing.Observe.\n213|\tPresented   fencing.PresentedToken\n214|\tObservation fencing.Observation\n215|\n216|\t// Backend carries the §4.B identity documents.\n217|\tBackend BackendFacts\n218|\n219|\t// Journal is the loaded materialization journal; JournalOK\n220|\t// reports that the matjournal owner admitted it. When\n221|\t// MaterializationRequired is set (the after-restore step 3),\n222|\t// a local launch additionally requires the committed phase.\n223|\t// A fresh launch (§13.1 steps 3-4) runs before the journal\n224|\t// commits and leaves the requirement unset.\n225|\tMaterializationRequired bool\n226|\tJournal                 matjournal.Journal\n227|\tJournalOK               bool\n228|\n229|\t// Checkpoint carries the resume checkpoint: Required when the\n230|\t// path resumes from a checkpoint, Doc with its bytes, ID with\n231|\t// the expected digest. Admission runs through the sessrepo\n232|\t// attestation owner.\n233|\tCheckpointRequired bool\n234|\tCheckpointDoc      []byte\n235|\tCheckpointID       string\n236|\n237|\t// ProfileRecord and ProfileEvents are the decoded session\n238|\t// surface the sessprofile reducer derives the effective pair\n239|\t// from.\n240|\tProfileRecord sessprofile.Record\n241|\tProfileEvents []sessprofile.Event\n242|\n243|\t// Provider carries the probed build, stored identity, and\n244|\t// optional discovery proof.\n245|\tProvider ProviderFacts\n246|\n247|\t// Smoke carries the provider-auth smoke precondition.\n248|\tSmoke SmokeFacts\n249|\n250|\t// Realm carries the caller realm and broker readiness.\n251|\tRealm Realm\n252|\n253|\t// Entrypoint is the wrapper argv, checked against the §4.A\n254|\t// stable entrypoint rule.\n255|\tEntrypoint []string\n256|\n257|\t// Descriptor is the §7.A provider descriptor document the\n258|\t// wrapper supplies; HostBinding is the AX-validated host-local\n259|\t// binding it must match. Admission runs on the launch and\n260|\t// reattach paths only: parked, refused, and remote-offer\n261|\t// outcomes start no local provider.\n262|\tDescriptor  []byte\n263|\tHostBinding terminalbackend.InstanceBinding\n264|\n265|\t// RemoteInteractive reports that the remote owner holds the\n266|\t// session in an interactive terminal (after-restore step 4).\n267|\tRemoteInteractive bool\n268|}\n269|\n270|// Decision is the one outcome Decide returns.\n271|type Decision struct {\n272|\t// Action is the outcome.\n273|\tAction Action\n274|\t// ParkReason and WinningLeaseID carry the session.parked\n275|\t// vocabulary when Action is parked. The lease ID is empty when\n276|\t// no winner is established.\n277|\tParkReason     fencing.ParkReason\n278|\tWinningLeaseID string\n279|\t// Class is the Section 15 refusal code when Action is refused.\n280|\tClass string\n281|\t// Detail is the static refusal or park detail. It carries\n282|\t// member names and the landed cause, never credentials,\n283|\t// generations, or native references.\n284|\tDetail string\n285|\t// Cause is the underlying landed error.\n286|\tCause error\n287|\t// Token is the sealed fencing token the passed gate minted,\n288|\t// set on launch and reattach only. The provider receives it\n289|\t// separately from the descriptor (§7.A).\n290|\tToken fencing.LeaseToken\n291|\t// HasToken reports that Token is minted. The zero token never\n292|\t// authorizes: decisions without a passed gate carry none.\n293|\tHasToken bool\n294|\t// Profile is the effective persisted pair the launch carries.\n295|\tProfile sessprofile.Pair\n296|\t// Mapping is the resolved provider adapter flag (empty for\n297|\t// standard).\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
