{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cf27","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0c8-2197-71f2-b37c-575c8ab978c8"},"sequence":1518,"recorded_at":1780531400003031,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0d0-7c03-7d10-92dc-7ff267936b06"},"task_id":"01a0b0d0-7c03-7d10-92dc-7ff267936b06","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0d0-7c03-7d10-92dc-7ff267936b06","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 233-245\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-\t// Checkpoint carries the resume checkpoint: Required when the\n-\t// path resumes from a checkpoint, Doc with its bytes, ID with\n-\t// the expected digest. Admission runs through the sessrepo\n-\t// attestation owner.\n-\tCheckpointRequired bool\n-\tCheckpointDoc      []byte\n-\tCheckpointID       string\n-\n-\t// ProfileRecord and ProfileEvents are the decoded session\n-\t// surface the sessprofile reducer derives the effective pair\n-\t// from.\n-\tProfileRecord sessprofile.Record\n-\tProfileEvents []sessprofile.Event\n+\t// Checkpoint carries the resume checkpoint: Required when the\n+\t// path resumes from a checkpoint, Doc with its bytes, ID with\n+\t// the expected digest. Admission attests through the sessrepo\n+\t// owner, requires exactly the winning lease's checkpoint, and\n+\t// binds the checkpoint's own session_id to this session.\n+\tCheckpointRequired bool\n+\tCheckpointDoc      []byte\n+\tCheckpointID       string\n+\n+\t// ProfileRecord and ProfileEvents are the decoded session\n+\t// surface the sessprofile reducer derives the effective pair\n+\t// from. ProfileHeads, when non-empty, is the validated\n+\t// checkpoint's event-head closure: resume derives from the\n+\t// closure (DeriveForHeads), never the session head, so a\n+\t// head-only or losing-lease change cannot become the launch\n+\t// profile. Run loads the heads from the winner's checkpoint;\n+\t// I/O-free callers supply them by hand.\n+\tProfileRecord sessprofile.Record\n+\tProfileEvents []sessprofile.Event\n+\tProfileHeads  []string\n","final_result":true}}}
