heckpoint) a new operation supersedes through Supersede, never\n+// through this no-replace entry. The candidate's session and\n+// operation must equal the call arguments; its instance ID and\n+// binding digest are validated, and the store stamps created_at at\n+// install. The stored receipt is authoritative on retry: a retry\n+// carrying different child facts still reattaches to the one\n+// recorded child, never to a second child. Stale staging files\n+// from a pre-commit crash are swept before the install.\n+func (store *Store) Bind(sessionID, operationID string, candidate Binding) (Binding, bool, error) {\n","final_result":true}}}
