son member: %s\", testCase.reason, stored)\n75|\t\t}\n76|\t\tsequence++\n77|\t\tpredecessor = reference.EventID\n78|\t}\n79|}\n80|\n81|// TestLaunchCarriesValidatedPlan pins the §13.1 step-4 surface the\n82|// wrapper hands to the later provider-launch leaf: the resolved\n83|// adapter mapping, the admitted §7.A descriptor, and the sealed\n84|// fencing token travel together on every launch, and no launch\n85|// ships a partial plan.\n86|func TestLaunchCarriesValidatedPlan(t *testing.T) {\n87|\tt.Parallel()\n88|\tdeps := buildDecideDeps(t, true)\n89|\tdecision := Decide(validInput(t, deps))\n90|\tif decision.Action != ActionLaunch {\n91|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Decide() action = %q, want launch\", decision.Action)\n92|\t}\n93|\tif !decision.HasToken {\n94|\t\tt.Fatal(\"launch carries no fencing token\")\n95|\t}\n96|\tif decision.Descriptor.TerminalInstanceID == \"\" {\n97|\t\tt.Fatal(\"launch carries no admitted descriptor\")\n98|\t}\n99|\tif len(decision.Admitted.Capabilities) == 0 {\n100|\t\tt.Fatal(\"launch carries no admitted capabilities\")\n101|\t}\n102|}\n103|\n104|// TestConformanceMatrixCompleteness enumerates the pinned clauses\n105|// and the named top-level test that drives each through a\n106|// production entry, then verifies every named test exists in this\n107|// package through the go list entry. A row fails if its test is\n108|// removed or renamed without updating the matrix; subtest rows in\n109|// TRACEABILITY.md refine these top-level drivers.\n110|func TestConformanceMatrixCompleteness(t *testing.T) {\n111|\tt.Parallel()\n112|\trows := []struct {\n113|\t\tclause string\n114|\t\ttest   string\n115|\t}{\n116|\t\t{\"4.B manifest/probe/evidence identity\", \"TestDecideLaunchPositive\"},\n117|\t\t{\"4.B mismatch fails before activation\", \"TestDecideTable\"},\n118|\t\t{\"4.C wrapper rule order\", \"TestDecideArmPrecedence\"},\n119|\t\t{\"4.C bootstrap idempotency mismatch\", \"TestDecideTable\"},\n120|\t\t{\"4.C identical retry reattaches\", \"TestBindIdenticalRetryReattaches\"},\n121|\t\t{\"4.C concurrent commit reattaches\", \"TestBindConcurrentSameOperationReattaches\"},\n122|\t\t{\"4.C status proves absence\", \"TestBindInstallsAndStatusProves\"},\n123|\t\t{\"4.C unknown is not absent\", \"TestStatusUnknownIsNotAbsent\"},\n124|\t\t{\"4.C no PID persisted\", \"TestBindingPersistsNoPID\"},\n125|\t\t{\"4.C crash at the binding seam\", \"TestBindCrashChildSelfTerminates\"},\n126|\t\t{\"4.D only admitted rows authorize\", \"TestDecideTable\"},\n127|\t\t{\"4.2 background caller capability_unavailable\", \"TestDecideTypedRefusals\"},\n128|\t\t{\"4.2 cached evidence never authorizes\", \"TestRealmCarriesNoCachedEvidence\"},\n129|\t\t{\"4.2 after-restore sequence\", \"TestDecideAfterRestoreSequence\"},\n130|\t\t{\"5.2 session.parked vocabulary\", \"TestEmitParkedVocabularyLoop\"},\n131|\t\t{\"5.2 parked emission under lease\", \"TestEmitParkedRoundTrip\"},\n132|\t\t{\"5.2 v4 terminal payloads\", \"TestEmitTerminalV4RoundTrip\"},\n133|\t\t{\"7.A descriptor build and admit\", \"TestDescriptorBuildAdmitRoundTrip\"},\n134|\t\t{\"7.A descriptor mismatch refuses\", \"TestDescriptorMismatchRefuses\"},\n135|\t\t{\"7.A generation bounds\", \"TestDescriptorGenerationBounds\"},\n136|\t\t{\"7.A token passed separately\", \"TestDecideForgedTokensRefuse\"},\n137|\t\t{\"13.1 step 3 durable terminal entry\", \"TestRunLaunchBinds\"},\n138|\t\t{\"13.1 step 4 validated plan\", \"TestLaunchCarriesValidatedPlan\"},\n139|\t\t{\"2.4 effective profile and source\", \"TestDecideProfileSourcePinsEvent\"},\n140|\t\t{\"2.4 mapping refusal\", \"TestDecideYoloMapping\"},\n141|\t\t{\"orchestrated launch/reattach/park/refuse\", \"TestRunParkedEmits\"},\n142|\t\t{\"ownership observation over leases\", \"TestObserveLoadsWinningLease\"},\n143|\t}\n144|\tlisted, err := exec.Command(\"go\", \"test\", \".\", \"-list\", \".\", \"-count=1\").CombinedOutput()\n145|\tif err != nil {\n146|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"go test -list error = %v: %s\", err, listed)\n147|\t}\n148|\tp