{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e1b9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0c8-2197-71f2-b37c-575c8ab978c8"},"sequence":3895,"recorded_at":1780531400007785,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0e3-8d2c-7943-81df-8506859f640a"},"task_id":"01a0b0e3-8d2c-7943-81df-8506859f640a","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0e3-8d2c-7943-81df-8506859f640a","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 59-62\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-| Unverified ownership parks | `Decide` → `fencing.AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/parked_unverified`, `TestRunParkedEmits` | Driven: without a proving lease refresh the wrapper parks and authors the parked event under the winner. |\n-| Failed handoff parks | `Decide` → `fencing.AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/parked_failed_handoff` | Driven: a losing force lease parks `failed_handoff`, never activates. |\n-| Remote interactive owner offers attach | `Decide` → `decideParked` + `terminalbackend.CheckOperation(\"attach\")` | `TestDecideTable/attach_remote_interactive` | Driven: a remote winning holder with an interactive terminal and an admitted attach capability offers `attach_remote` with no lease mutation. |\n-| Remote owner otherwise offers takeover | `Decide` → `decideParked` | `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_noninteractive`, `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_attach_unproven`, `TestRunTakeoverOfferEmitsParked` | Driven: a non-interactive or attach-unproven remote owner offers `takeover_offer`, starts no runtime, and still authors the `remote_owner` parked event. |\n+| Unverified ownership parks | `Decide` → `fencing.AuthorizeActivation`; `Emit` → `fencing.AuthorizeMutation` refuses | `TestDecideTable/parked_unverified`, `TestEmitParkedVocabularyLoop/refuses_unverified` | Driven: without a proving lease refresh the wrapper parks `restore_policy` with no chain event — the mutation gate refuses unverified emission. |\n+| Failed handoff parks | `Decide` → `fencing.AuthorizeActivation`; `Emit` → `fencing.AuthorizeMutation` refuses | `TestDecideTable/parked_failed_handoff`, `TestEmitParkedVocabularyLoop/refuses_failed_handoff` | Driven: a losing force lease parks `failed_handoff`, never activates and never emits. |\n+| Remote interactive owner offers attach | `Decide` → `decideParked` + `terminalbackend.CheckOperation(\"attach\")`; `Run` skips remote emission | `TestDecideTable/attach_remote_interactive` | Driven: a remote winning holder with an interactive terminal and an admitted attach capability offers `attach_remote` with no lease mutation and no chain event under the remote lease. |\n+| Remote owner otherwise parks or offers takeover | `Decide` → `decideParked`; `Run` skips remote emission | `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_noninteractive`, `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_attach_unproven`, `TestRunTakeoverOfferEmitsParked` | Driven: a non-interactive remote owner parks `remote_owner` (§4.2 step 5); an interactive attach-unproven remote owner offers `takeover_offer`. Both start no runtime and author no chain event under the remote lease. |\n","final_result":true}}}
