{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e1ed","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0c8-2197-71f2-b37c-575c8ab978c8"},"sequence":3921,"recorded_at":1780531400007837,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0e3-aea8-75d2-83c7-f153329df941"},"task_id":"01a0b0e3-aea8-75d2-83c7-f153329df941","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0e3-aea8-75d2-83c7-f153329df941","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 64-66\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-| Materialization validity gates local resume | `Decide` (journal arm); `Run` → `LoadMaterialization` | `TestDecideTable/parked_materialization_not_committed`, `TestDecideTable/parked_materialization_absent`, `TestRunRestoreCommitted`, `TestRunRestoreMaterializingParks` | Driven: a required journal must be admitted by the `matjournal` owner and committed (stated phase rule); staging or absence parks `restore_policy`. Fresh launch leaves the requirement unset (§13.1 runs before the journal commits). |\n-| Checkpoint admission gates resume | `Decide` → `admitCheckpoint` → `sessrepo.AttestCheckpointRecord`; `Run` → `LoadCheckpoint` | `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_inadmissible`, `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_absent`, `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_wrong_identity`, `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_flipped_digest` | Driven: a required checkpoint must attest through the `sessrepo` owner and match the required digest; garbage, absence, or identity drift parks `restore_policy`. |\n-| Effective profile derived with source | `Decide` → `sessprofile.Derive`; `Run` → `LoadProfile` | `TestDecideProfileSourcePinsEvent`, `TestDecideYoloMapping` | Driven: the launch carries the newest authoritative `profile.changed` target with that event's digest as source (PROFILE-DIRECT-RESUME direction); creation-only chains carry the record value with null source. Corrupt derivation refuses `integrity_failure` (`TestDecideTable/refused_profile_derivation_corrupt`). |\n+| Materialization validity gates local resume | `Decide` → `checkMaterialization`; `Run` → `LoadMaterialization` | `TestDecideTable/parked_materialization_not_committed`, `TestDecideTable/parked_materialization_absent`, `TestDecideMaterializationStaleParks`, `TestRunRestoreCommitted`, `TestRunRestoreMaterializingParks` | Driven: a required journal must be admitted by the `matjournal` owner, committed, and sourced from the winning lease's checkpoint; staging, absence, or a superseded source parks `restore_policy`. Fresh launch leaves the requirement unset (§13.1 runs before the journal commits). |\n+| Checkpoint admission gates resume | `Decide` → `admitCheckpoint` → `sessrepo.AttestCheckpointRecord`; `Run` → `LoadCheckpoint` | `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_inadmissible`, `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_absent`, `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_wrong_identity`, `TestDecideTable/parked_checkpoint_flipped_digest`, `TestDecideCheckpointNotLeaseParks`, `TestDecideForeignCheckpointParks` | Driven: a required checkpoint must attest through the `sessrepo` owner, match the required digest, equal the winning lease's checkpoint, and name this session; garbage, absence, identity drift, a non-lease checkpoint, or a foreign session parks `restore_policy`. |\n+| Effective profile derived with source | `Decide` → `deriveProfile` → `sessprofile.Derive`/`DeriveForHeads`; `Run` → `LoadProfile` + winner closure | `TestDecideProfileSourcePinsEvent`, `TestDecideYoloMapping`, `TestDecideResumeProfileUsesClosure`, `TestLosingLeaseProfileEventIgnored` | Driven: launch carries the session head (newest authoritative `profile.changed` with that event's digest, or the record value with null source); resume carries the validated checkpoint's event-head closure (`DeriveForHeads`), so a head-only or losing-lease change never becomes the launch profile (PROFILE-DIRECT-RESUME direction). Corrupt derivation refuses `integrity_failure` (`TestDecideTable/refused_profile_derivation_corrupt`). |\n","final_result":true}}}
