ects byte-identically (winner,\n2197|   conflicts, divergent-history warnings). Losing-branch evidence is a pure\n2198|   function of the union multiset: every entry below the final winner reports\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
