{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e3a5","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0c8-2197-71f2-b37c-575c8ab978c8"},"sequence":4141,"recorded_at":1780531400008277,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0e4-5960-79c1-8ea6-0d50546a911c"},"task_id":"01a0b0e4-5960-79c1-8ea6-0d50546a911c","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0e4-5960-79c1-8ea6-0d50546a911c","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 2154-2173\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-shapes from `axerror`. `Run` orchestrates the adapters over the durable stores\n-and applies exactly the authorized effect: launch binds the bootstrap\n-`(session_id, bootstrap_operation_id)` pair before any provider side effect,\n-reattach returns the one recorded child, parked and remote-offer decisions\n-author `session.parked` under the current lease, and refused decisions write\n-nothing. The bootstrap store installs under the no-replace plus fsync\n-discipline with crash hooks, persists no PID, and reattaches linearizably on\n-the commit race; a background caller without an attested server refuses\n-`capability_unavailable` with typed realm/readiness details, and no cached\n-sentinel or `managername` observation can authorize resume.\n-\n-Run the focused tests and coverage with:\n-\n-```bash\n-go test ./internal/axpane -count=1\n-go test ./internal/axpane -cover -count=1\n-```\n-\n-Run the narrowing battery (24 narrowing mutants plus one harmless control)\n-with:\n+shapes from `axerror`, and lifecycle foldability from `sessstate`. `Run`\n+orchestrates the adapters over the durable stores and applies exactly the\n+authorized effect: launch binds the bootstrap `(session_id,\n+bootstrap_operation_id)` pair before any provider side effect (superseding\n+atomically after the window closes), reattach returns the one recorded child,\n+verified locally held foldable parks author `session.parked` under the winning\n+lease through the `AuthorizeMutation` gate, remote/unverifiable/unfolderable\n+parks author no chain event, and refused decisions write nothing. The bootstrap\n+store installs under the no-replace plus fsync discipline with crash hooks,\n+persists no PID, reattaches linearizably on the commit race, and sweeps stale\n+pre-commit staging; a background caller authorizes only through the admitted\n+`credential_capable_execution_realm` row bound to the host binding, probed\n+build, and current generation, refusing `capability_unavailable` with typed\n+realm/readiness details otherwise, and no cached sentinel, `managername`\n+observation, or bare boolean can authorize resume. Resume derives the\n+effective profile from the validated checkpoint's event-head closure, and a\n+non-interactive create requires `headless_creation`.\n+\n+Run the focused tests and coverage with:\n+\n+```bash\n+go test ./internal/axpane -count=1\n+go test ./internal/axpane -cover -count=1\n+```\n+\n+Run the narrowing battery (35 narrowing mutants plus one harmless control)\n+with:\n","final_result":true}}}
