admission | `Decide` → `Reconcile` | `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_evidence_expired`, `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_signature_untrusted` | Driven |\n17|| Mismatch fails before activation | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | above four rows | Driven |\n18|\n19|## §4.C Lifecycle and operations + §4.1/§4.2 wrapper rule\n20|\n21|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n22|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n23|| Validate configuration | `Run` → `ValidateConfig` → `config.Load`; `Decide` config arm | `TestDecideTable/refused_config_invalid`, `TestRunInvalidConfig` | Driven |\n24|| Load the logical session | `Run` → `LoadSession`; `Decide` session arm | `TestDecideTable/refused_unknown_session`, `TestRunUnknownSession` | Driven |\n25|| Synchronize lease records when possible | `Run` → `ObserveOwnership` → `fencing.Observe` | `TestObserveLoadsWinningLease`, `TestRunLaunchBinds` | Driven |\n26|| Compare the local fencing token before launching | `Decide` → `fencing.AuthorizeActivation/AuthorizeRestore` | Full fencing table (lower/losing/future/foreign/expired/malformed rows) | Driven |\n27|| Park when remote, ambiguous, or unverified | `Decide` → `decideParked` | `TestDecideTable/parked_*`, `TestDecideTable/attach_remote_interactive`, `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_*` | Driven |\n28|| Idempotent on `(session_id, bootstrap_operation_id)` | `Store.Bind`, `Decide` idempotency arm | `TestBindIdenticalRetryReattaches`, `TestDecideTable/reattach_same_pair`, `TestRunReattaches` | Driven |\n29|| Changed operation in-window → `idempotency_mismatch` | `Store.Bind`, `Decide` | `TestBindChangedOperationRefusesMismatch`, `TestDecideTable/refused_idempotency_mismatch`, `TestRunIdempotencyMismatch` | Driven |\n30|| Status + binding prove absence or the one child | `Store.Status` | `TestBindInstallsAndStatusProves`, `TestStatusUnknownIsNotAbsent`, `TestStatusSessionMismatchRefuses` | Driven |\n31|| Commit race is linearizable | `Store.Bind` (EEXIST re-read) | `TestBindConcurrentSame