`/parked_future_epoch` | Driven |\n93|| Foreign session / expired grant / malformed token | `Decide` → `AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/refused_fencing_foreign_session`, `/refused_fencing_expired_grant`, `/refused_fencing_malformed_token` | Driven |\n94|| Absent / ambiguous / unverified / failed handoff | `Decide` → `AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/parked_absent_winner`, `/parked_ambiguous`, `/parked_unverified`, `/parked_failed_handoff` | Driven |\n95|\n96|## Provider identity composition detail (via the `provhost` owner)\n97|\n98|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n99|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n100|| Resume tuple gate | `Decide` → `provhost.CheckResumeTuple` | `TestDecideTable/refused_provider_tuple_qwen` | Driven |\n101|| Identity bind to exact build | `Decide` → `provhost.VerifyIdentityBuild` | `TestDecideTable/refused_provider_identity_other_provider` | Driven |\n102|| Discovery bind | `Decide` → `provhost.VerifyIdentityDiscovery` | `TestDecideTable/launch_discovery_bound`, `/refused_discovery_native_mismatch`, `/refused_discovery_root_outside`, `/refused_discovery_empty_home` | Driven |\n103|| Smoke precondition + typed `target_auth_missing` | `Decide` → `resumesmoke.VerifyRecord` + `axerror.NewTargetAuthMissing` | `TestDecideTable/refused_smoke_failing_verdict`, `/refused_smoke_absent`, `/refused_smoke_wrong_build`, `TestRunSmokeRequiredPasses` | Driven |\n104|\n105|## Wrapper-rule structure\n106|\n107|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n108|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n109|| Arm precedence (first fault wins) | `Decide` | `TestDecideArmPrecedence` | Driven |\n110|| Orchestrated effects (bind / return / emit / nothing) | `Run` | `TestRunLaunchBinds`, `TestRunReattaches`, `TestRunParkedEmits`, `TestRunRefusedWritesNothing` | Driven |\n111|| Store failure propagates without decision | `Run` | `TestRunTornBindingPropagates` | Driven |\n112|| Matrix completeness (named tests exist) | `go test -list` | `TestCo