{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e9c1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0c8-2197-71f2-b37c-575c8ab978c8"},"sequence":4923,"recorded_at":1780531400009841,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"53d7abd4-2111-4f48-89d8-7ded249d4ac3"},"call_id":"call_01a0b0f448e073a1a906a0fdfc93352c","text":"Read text file `/tmp/TASK-260830-1geqhj_conformance-matrix-rev2.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-1geqhj conformance matrix — ax pane enforcement wrapper\n2|\n3|Normative authority: relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec v0.5.0\n4|(commit `28bf96d`), worked against `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md`.\n5|Every clause below is driven through the named production entry by the\n6|named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. AC ratio: 41 of 41.\n7|\n8|## §4.B Registry, identity, discovery, and trust\n9|\n10|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n11|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n12|| Manifest/Probe/Evidence closed identity + digest rule | `Decide` → `terminalbackend.ParseManifest/ParseProbe/ParseEvidence` | `TestDecideLaunchPositive` | Driven |\n13|| Manifest-to-Probe reconciliation + keyed relation | `Decide` → `terminalbackend.Reconcile` | `TestDecideLaunchPositive`, `TestDecideRestoreRequiresRestoreCapability` | Driven |\n14|| Generation binding | `Decide` → `Reconcile` | `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_generation_mismatch` (→ the more specific `terminal_backend_stale_generation`) | Driven |\n15|| Protocol/platform membership | `Decide` → `Reconcile` | `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_protocol_membership` | Driven |\n16|| Evidence liveness + signature before admission | `Decide` → `Reconcile` | `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_evidence_expired`, `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_signature_untrusted` | Driven |\n17|| Mismatch fails before activation | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | above four rows | Driven |\n18|\n19|## §4.C Lifecycle and operations + §4.1/§4.2 wrapper rule\n20|\n21|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n22|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n23|| Validate configuration | `Run` → `ValidateConfig` → `config.Load`; `Decide` config arm | `TestDecideTable/refused_config_invalid`, `TestRunInvalidConfig` | Driven |\n24|| Load the logical session | `Run` → `LoadSession`; `Decide` session arm | `TestDecideTable/refused_unknown_session`, `TestRunUnknownSession` | Driven |\n25|| Synchronize lease records when possible | `Run` → `ObserveOwnership` → `fencing.Observe` | `TestObserveLoadsWinningLease`, `TestRunLaunchBinds` | Driven |\n26|| Compare the local fencing token before launching | `Decide` → `fencing.AuthorizeActivation/AuthorizeRestore` | Full fencing table (lower/losing/future/foreign/expired/malformed rows) | Driven |\n27|| Park when remote, ambiguous, or unverified | `Decide` → `decideParked` | `TestDecideTable/parked_*`, `TestDecideTable/attach_remote_interactive`, `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_*` | Driven |\n28|| Idempotent on `(session_id, bootstrap_operation_id)` | `Store.Bind`, `Decide` idempotency arm | `TestBindIdenticalRetryReattaches`, `TestDecideTable/reattach_same_pair`, `TestRunReattaches` | Driven |\n29|| Changed operation in-window → `idempotency_mismatch` | `Store.Bind`, `Decide` | `TestBindChangedOperationRefusesMismatch`, `TestDecideTable/refused_idempotency_mismatch`, `TestRunIdempotencyMismatch` | Driven |\n30|| Status + binding prove absence or the one child | `Store.Status` | `TestBindInstallsAndStatusProves`, `TestStatusUnknownIsNotAbsent`, `TestStatusSessionMismatchRefuses` | Driven |\n31|| Commit race is linearizable | `Store.Bind` (EEXIST re-read) | `TestBindConcurrentSameOperationReattaches`, `TestBindConcurrentChangedOperationRefuses`, `TestRunConcurrentLaunchReattaches` | Driven |\n32|| Crash at the binding seam | `Store.Bind` + `Hooks` | `TestBindCrashChildSelfTerminates` (real SIGKILL), `TestBindHookAfterStageAbortsWithoutInstall`, `TestBindHookAfterInstallKeepsTheCommit` | Driven |\n33|| Never persist or replicate a PID | `Store.Bind` (closed receipt) | `TestBindingPersistsNoPID` | Driven |\n34|| Background caller: no credential-dependent server creation; `capability_unavailable` with typed realm/readiness | `Decide` → `checkRealm` → `axerror.NewRealmEvidenceUnavailable` | `TestDecideTable/refused_realm_background_no_server`, `TestDecideTypedRefusals/capability_unavailable_details`, `TestDecideTable/launch_background_attested_server` | Driven |\n35|| Cached sentinel / `managername` never authorize resume | `Realm` struct (structural: no member) | `TestRealmCarriesNoCachedEvidence` | Driven |\n36|| Stable entrypoint `ax pane SESSION_ID` | `Decide` → `terminalbackend.CheckEntrypoint` | `TestDecideTable/refused_entrypoint_raw_provider` | Driven |\n37|| After-restore sequence 1-5 | `Decide` in restore mode | `TestDecideAfterRestoreSequence` (6 scenarios) | Driven |\n38|| Mode selects activation/restore entry | `Decide` → `authorize` | `TestDecideRestoreRequiresRestoreCapability`, `TestDecideTable/launch_restore_committed_checkpoint` | Driven |\n39|| Bounded mesh lease refresh (step 2) | Caller-reported `Verified` fact | — | Stated bound: no network in this leaf |\n40|| Backend operation errors (`terminal_backend_unavailable` at the call site) | — | — | Stated bound: no backend operation exists in this leaf |\n41|\n42|## §4.D Closed capabilities and evidence\n43|\n44|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n45|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n46|| Only exact admitted rows authorize an action | `Decide` → `terminalbackend.CheckOperation` | `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_capability_unproven` | Driven |\n47|| Attach row gates `attach_remote` | `Decide` → `decideParked` + `CheckOperation(\"attach\")` | `TestDecideTable/takeover_offer_attach_unproven` | Driven |\n48|| No capability map invented | `Reconcile` set is the only authority | Structural (every admission flows through `admitBackend`) + unproven row | Driven |\n49|| Mode selects create/restore row | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | `TestDecideRestoreRequiresRestoreCapability` | Driven |\n50|\n51|## §5.2 Terminal Events\n52|\n53|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n54|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n55|| `session.parked` reason vocabulary | `ParkedPayload` | `TestParkedPayloadVocabulary` | Driven |\n56|| Parked authored under the current lease | `EmitParked` → `Emit` → `sessrepo.AppendEvent` | `TestEmitParkedRoundTrip`, `TestEmitParkedVocabularyLoop`, `TestRunParkedEmits`, `TestRunTakeoverOfferEmitsParked` | Driven |\n57|| Parked without winner authors nothing | `Run` (emission skip) | `TestRunParkedWithoutWinnerSkipsEmission` | Driven |\n58|| Non-parked emission refuses | `EmitParked` | `TestEmitParkedRefusesNonParked` | Driven |\n59|| v4 `terminal.created` closed payload + append | `TerminalCreatedPayload`, `Emit` | `TestTerminalCreatedPayload`, `TestEmitTerminalV4RoundTrip` | Driven |\n60|| v4 `session.resumed` closed payload + append | `ResumedPayload`, `Emit` | `TestResumedPayload`, `TestEmitTerminalV4RoundTrip` | Driven |\n61|\n62|## §7.A Provider Protocol 3.0.0 Terminal Instance binding\n63|\n64|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n65|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n66|| Wrapper supplies the closed descriptor (UUIDv7 instance, never a PID) | `BuildDescriptor`, `MintInstanceID` | `TestDescriptorBuildAdmitRoundTrip`, `TestMintInstanceID`, `TestDescriptorRefusesNonUUIDInstance`, `TestDescriptorRefusesBadGeometry` | Driven |\n67|| Provider rejects a mismatched binding before launch/observe | `Decide` → `terminalbackend.AdmitProviderDescriptor` | `TestDescriptorMismatchRefuses`, `TestDecideTable/refused_descriptor_generation_drift` | Driven |\n68|| Generation bound 1..256 | `AdmitProviderDescriptor` | `TestDescriptorGenerationBounds` (0 and 257 refuse, 256 admits) | Driven |\n69|| LeaseToken passed separately; zero token refuses all operations | `Decide` token projection → `fencing.LeaseToken.Bind` | `TestDecideLaunchPositive`, `TestDecideForgedTokensRefuse` | Driven |\n70|| Host-local binding arrives from the backend caller | `Request.HostBinding` input | — | Stated bound: the wrapper proves document-to-binding consistency, never mints backend bindings |\n71|\n72|## §13.1 Direct-session launch steps 3-4\n73|\n74|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n75|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n76|| Step 3: durable terminal entry with the bootstrap operation ID | `Run` → `Store.Bind` | `TestRunLaunchBinds`, `TestRunRestoreCommitted` | Driven |\n77|| Step 4: validated plan (mapping + descriptor + token) on launch | `Decide` | `TestLaunchCarriesValidatedPlan` | Driven |\n78|| Provider launch / argv-env supervision | — | — | Stated bound: later leaf |\n79|\n80|## §2.4 Execution profiles (composed authority)\n81|\n82|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n83|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n84|| Effective persisted profile + source (PROFILE-DIRECT-RESUME) | `Decide` → `sessprofile.Derive`; `Run` → `LoadProfile` | `TestDecideProfileSourcePinsEvent`, `TestDecideYoloMapping` | Driven |\n85|| Corrupt derivation refuses | `Decide` | `TestDecideTable/refused_profile_derivation_corrupt` | Driven |\n86|| Resume fails `profile_mapping_unavailable` when unmappable | `Decide` → `provhost.ResolveMapping` | `TestDecideTable/refused_profile_mapping_unavailable` | Driven |\n87|\n88|## Fencing composition detail (via the `fencing` owner)\n89|\n90|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n91|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n92|| Lower / losing / future epoch | `Decide` → `AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/parked_lower_epoch`, `/parked_same_epoch_loser`, `/parked_future_epoch` | Driven |\n93|| Foreign session / expired grant / malformed token | `Decide` → `AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/refused_fencing_foreign_session`, `/refused_fencing_expired_grant`, `/refused_fencing_malformed_token` | Driven |\n94|| Absent / ambiguous / unverified / failed handoff | `Decide` → `AuthorizeActivation` | `TestDecideTable/parked_absent_winner`, `/parked_ambiguous`, `/parked_unverified`, `/parked_failed_handoff` | Driven |\n95|\n96|## Provider identity composition detail (via the `provhost` owner)\n97|\n98|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n99|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n100|| Resume tuple gate | `Decide` → `provhost.CheckResumeTuple` | `TestDecideTable/refused_provider_tuple_qwen` | Driven |\n101|| Identity bind to exact build | `Decide` → `provhost.VerifyIdentityBuild` | `TestDecideTable/refused_provider_identity_other_provider` | Driven |\n102|| Discovery bind | `Decide` → `provhost.VerifyIdentityDiscovery` | `TestDecideTable/launch_discovery_bound`, `/refused_discovery_native_mismatch`, `/refused_discovery_root_outside`, `/refused_discovery_empty_home` | Driven |\n103|| Smoke precondition + typed `target_auth_missing` | `Decide` → `resumesmoke.VerifyRecord` + `axerror.NewTargetAuthMissing` | `TestDecideTable/refused_smoke_failing_verdict`, `/refused_smoke_absent`, `/refused_smoke_wrong_build`, `TestRunSmokeRequiredPasses` | Driven |\n104|\n105|## Wrapper-rule structure\n106|\n107|| Clause | Production entry | Named test(s) | Verdict |\n108|| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n109|| Arm precedence (first fault wins) | `Decide` | `TestDecideArmPrecedence` | Driven |\n110|| Orchestrated effects (bind / return / emit / nothing) | `Run` | `TestRunLaunchBinds`, `TestRunReattaches`, `TestRunParkedEmits`, `TestRunRefusedWritesNothing` | Driven |\n111|| Store failure propagates without decision | `Run` | `TestRunTornBindingPropagates` | Driven |\n112|| Matrix completeness (named tests exist) | `go test -list` | `TestConformanceMatrixCompleteness` | Driven |","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
